Package: CrossHeat
Title: Cross-Species Heatmaps of Gene Modules from Single-Cell Data
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R: 
    person("Yann", "Tapponnier", email = "Yann.tapponnier@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Draws side-by-side heatmaps of the same gene modules across several
    Seurat objects from human and mouse. Gene symbols are mapped through an ortholog
    table computed once, then shown as genes x cells, genes x groups (with a
    minimum-cell mask) or modules x groups, with z-score clipping, bar plots of
    expressing cells and PNG export.
